Native ESP-IDF dependencies
==========================

This project uses ESP-IDF and its bundled FreeRTOS. Add project-specific native
components under firmware/components/<driver>/ with a CMakeLists.txt and declare
application dependencies in src/CMakeLists.txt. Managed components are pinned in
src/idf_component.yml and dependencies.lock.

Do not add Arduino libraries here. The active measurement adapter is
src/idf/sensors.c; see firmware/README.md for the source layout and driver path.
